===== 4. ConfigMap update needs a rollout restart =====

$ kubectl -n app-config patch configmap yatri-app-config --type merge -p '{"data":{"ENVIRONMENT":"staging"}}'
configmap/yatri-app-config patched

$ kubectl -n app-config get configmap yatri-app-config -o jsonpath='configmap now says: {.data.ENVIRONMENT}{"\n"}'
configmap now says: staging
# the running pod still has the OLD value:

$ kubectl -n app-config exec deploy/yatri-backend -- env | grep ENVIRONMENT
ENVIRONMENT=production

$ kubectl -n app-config rollout restart deployment/yatri-backend
deployment.apps/yatri-backend restarted

$ kubectl -n app-config rollout status deployment/yatri-backend --timeout=180s
Waiting for deployment "yatri-backend" rollout to finish: 1 out of 2 new replicas have been updated...
